// A dereference inside print(), typed and untyped.
//
// A call waits for the whole value, so print() prints each reply once, when
// the model has finished it. To show a reply as the model writes it, pipe it:
// `?p |> write` calls write once per piece.

prompt p = "What is 3 + 4? Respond with only the number."

// The int arrives complete, then prints.
print(toInt(?p))

// The whole reply, printed once.
print(?p)
